{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:93f69e6022f50a8c","name":"Piracy Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-93f69e6022f50a8c","title":"Piracy Talent Tree","revision":19728,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:30:15Z","sha256":"3ec341a682e405318171d3ad9c2e4488a186d3970a877e9f612e24ad27003648","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19728","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Piracy%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-93f69e6022f50a8c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You use devious tactics to capture ships and victims intact.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Bloodthirsty"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can perform a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coup de Grace"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coup_de_Grace","referenceId":"reference:c94e9876e3ba371d"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},". Whenever you successfully perform a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coup de Grace"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coup_de_Grace","referenceId":"reference:c94e9876e3ba371d"}," Action and kill the target, all allies within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," gain a +2 morale bonus on attack rolls for the duration of the encounter.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Fight to the Death"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Bloodthirsty"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can fill your companions with renewed vigor. All allies within 6 squares of you heal damage equal to your Heroic Level.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Keep Them Reeling in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Keep Them Reeling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Keep_Them_Reeling"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Keep Them Moving"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against a target within ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reach"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reach"},". If the attack hits, you deal no damage, but your target must ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Withdraw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Withdraw","referenceId":"reference:164546a9c5481480"}," away from you on its next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Raider's Frenzy"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per round, when one of your allies within 6 squares successfully damages a target, you grant all your allies within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," a bonus to damage rolls against that target equal to one-half your Class Level until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Raider's Surge"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check (your choice) against each enemy within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". If the check result equals or exceeds the enemy's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", that enemy must ",{"tag":"a","children":["Withdraw"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Withdraw","referenceId":"reference:164546a9c5481480"}," on its next Action or take a -1 penalty on its attack rolls until the end of the encounter. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Savage Reputation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Bloodthirsty"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You have cultivated a ",{"tag":"b","children":["Savage Reputation"]},", and when you are recognized, you instill fear in your enemies. All opponents within 6 squares of you take a -1 penalty to all their attack rolls. This is a Mind-Affecting Fear effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Take Them Alive"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you or any of your allies within 6 squares of you reduces a target to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},", you can choose to treat that opponent as though they had been reduced to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage (and thus, remain stable).\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
